WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
This show contains scenes that some viewers may 
find disturbing.​ Viewer discretion ​is ​advised.

00:01.400 --> 00:02.980
This is bad.

00:05.810 --> 00:10.220
Tonight, I'll be showing you eight ways 
to kill goblins without making a sound...

00:05.960 --> 00:09.590
<b>Onward to Adventure</b>

00:12.360 --> 00:13.640
Wh-What was that?!

00:13.640 --> 00:14.570
A scream?

00:20.540 --> 00:23.380
H-Hey! I think something happened!

00:23.380 --> 00:24.750
Quiet down.

00:25.290 --> 00:27.640
Make a semicircle around the spell casters.

00:28.020 --> 00:29.750
Those on the front line, 
ready your weapons.

00:31.230 --> 00:32.130
Got it.

00:32.130 --> 00:35.080
Hey! Quit dawdling! 
We need to get into formation.

00:35.080 --> 00:36.460
R-Right.

00:36.460 --> 00:37.340
Got it!

00:37.340 --> 00:39.810
You there! Get your shield up!

00:40.260 --> 00:41.890
Stand by.

00:42.450 --> 00:45.850
If I don't return in fifteen minutes, 
you'll need to act on your own.

00:45.850 --> 00:47.230
On our own?

00:47.230 --> 00:51.320
Because it'll mean that I've 
been killed, or at least injured.

02:37.570 --> 02:39.340
So it was goblins.

03:01.030 --> 03:02.780
Goblin Slayer!

03:03.130 --> 03:04.040
Are you all right?

03:04.040 --> 03:04.830
Yes.

03:07.420 --> 03:09.130
Th-This is...

03:21.000 --> 03:22.680
Do you have any miracles left?

03:22.970 --> 03:25.390
Yes. I managed to get some rest.

03:25.390 --> 03:27.890
I can fully apply all three.

03:30.250 --> 03:32.270
All of the goblins will be annihilated.

03:34.000 --> 03:36.020
Ah, so you're safe.

03:36.020 --> 03:39.710
Yeah. The ones I'm in charge of are all safe.

03:39.710 --> 03:44.870
I see. Most of the guys went home at dusk.

03:44.870 --> 03:48.450
Before... it got dark... right?

03:48.450 --> 03:50.590
I'm glad you two are also safe.

03:50.590 --> 03:52.400
We're here, too!

03:54.290 --> 03:55.250
Everyone!

03:56.070 --> 03:58.710
Thank goodness you're all safe!

03:59.470 --> 04:01.670
Heya, Goblin Slayer.

04:01.670 --> 04:03.200
Are you alone today?

04:03.200 --> 04:07.020
She's a woman, you know.
 She has days she can't move much.

04:07.020 --> 04:10.050
Our pipsqueaks are taking 
care of her at the inn.

04:17.460 --> 04:20.190
It's gonna suck if they just 
come barging in here.

04:20.190 --> 04:23.220
I'll be damned if I'm gonna 
go down guarding this place.

04:23.220 --> 04:31.790
Anyway... we should probably... 
all... group up... right?

04:32.040 --> 04:35.820
The ones I'm in charge of are 
standing by in the square.

04:35.820 --> 04:37.400
Then we need to send them a message.

04:37.400 --> 04:41.800
"We're now aware of the situation. 
There are goblins. Head this way."

04:41.800 --> 04:43.940
We need to inform the others 
and get them here, too.

04:43.940 --> 04:45.260
I'll go.

04:45.510 --> 04:48.000
I'm the fastest one here, after all.

04:48.000 --> 04:49.230
Good, thanks.

04:49.230 --> 04:50.600
Leave it to me!

04:52.810 --> 04:56.450
So, we know we're up against 
goblins, but who's leading them?

04:56.450 --> 05:00.630
Probably another goblin. Since they're 
being conniving, possibly a shaman.

05:00.630 --> 05:03.030
Where's their base?

05:03.700 --> 05:05.990
The way I see it...

05:05.990 --> 05:09.340
I highly doubt that they are 
all coming from one hole.

05:09.700 --> 05:11.910
I believe they have many 
holes in all directions.

05:11.910 --> 05:16.330
Tracking down their base from one 
of those would be the fastest.

05:16.330 --> 05:18.790
You know which is the main path?

05:18.790 --> 05:22.030
Actually, they're probably 
all connected inside.

05:25.840 --> 05:28.560
They probably started with 
one hole and then split them up

05:28.560 --> 05:30.140
right before they attacked.

05:30.140 --> 05:33.720
Well, that's settled, then. 
Let's head down the closest hole.

05:33.720 --> 05:38.000
Then... we still... have a problem.

05:38.000 --> 05:42.940
What are we... going to do... 
about the other... little ones?

05:43.370 --> 05:47.110
We either leave them here, 
take them with us, or have them flee...

05:48.420 --> 05:51.880
Well, my sword does better 
pointing up than down.

05:51.880 --> 05:54.910
I'll take the kids with me. 
You guys hunt down the hole.

05:54.910 --> 05:56.370
No problem.

05:56.690 --> 05:57.530
Oh...

05:57.850 --> 05:58.990
What's the matter?

05:58.990 --> 06:04.590
Um... the other newbie adventurers 
have already gone home, right?

06:04.800 --> 06:10.330
Yeah. Everyone other than the ones who 
stayed behind to do night battles went home.

06:10.330 --> 06:12.810
Whereabouts are they right now?

06:12.810 --> 06:14.540
What are you getting at?

06:14.540 --> 06:16.740
Um... uh...

06:16.740 --> 06:17.730
Tell us.

06:19.440 --> 06:24.370
I think the goblins may be after 
the newbies that headed home, too.

06:24.370 --> 06:25.790
What?

06:25.790 --> 06:27.740
I mean, it doesn't make sense.

06:28.100 --> 06:32.190
I know that goblins are 
cowardly, dastardly creatures.

06:32.190 --> 06:33.650
That's what I was taught.

06:34.070 --> 06:40.080
If I were a goblin, I'd never want to attack 
a place filled with strong adventurers.

06:40.500 --> 06:43.820
So we're not their main targets. 
I hadn't thought of that.

06:43.820 --> 06:47.030
So... I have a suggestion.

06:48.330 --> 06:51.000
I, um...

06:52.150 --> 06:53.470
I'll go!

06:53.820 --> 06:57.190
The new adventurers in our group are, um...

06:57.190 --> 07:01.600
two warriors, a cleric, and a wizard...

07:01.600 --> 07:06.070
So if they can get another priestess like me,

07:06.070 --> 07:08.410
that should be enough 
to change our situation.

07:08.410 --> 07:10.900
I'll go save them. Please, let me go.

07:11.170 --> 07:14.270
I personally think this is a good idea.

07:14.270 --> 07:19.400
We must strike the enemy base, 
yet we cannot abandon our new soldiers.

07:19.400 --> 07:20.910
This is a brilliant idea.

07:20.910 --> 07:24.000
That'd be a perfect 
rank-advancement test for you.

07:24.570 --> 07:25.580
Can you do it?

07:26.550 --> 07:27.720
I'll do it.

07:27.720 --> 07:28.680
I see.

07:29.290 --> 07:30.620
Then that's settled.

07:32.490 --> 07:34.890
Man, we're gonna be training again tomorrow.

07:35.170 --> 07:37.770
It's really rough doing this every day.

07:37.770 --> 07:40.310
I'd like to go on an 
actual adventure already.

07:40.310 --> 07:43.780
Yeah! I do much better 
in a real battle anyway.

07:43.780 --> 07:46.770
You've never even been in a real battle.

07:49.810 --> 07:51.820
No!

07:52.090 --> 07:53.130
N-No!

07:53.460 --> 07:54.650
Mommy...

08:04.180 --> 08:05.050
Move!

08:14.120 --> 08:15.520
How dare you?!

08:25.850 --> 08:30.110
Why would you decide to let her go 
off on her own while I'm not around?

08:30.330 --> 08:31.260
Are you upset?

08:31.260 --> 08:34.900
Not exactly... but aren't you worried?

08:34.900 --> 08:37.820
If worrying would make her 
mission work out better...

08:39.290 --> 08:40.410
Honestly...

08:42.380 --> 08:43.250
They're coming.

08:43.250 --> 08:44.830
How many? From what direction?

08:44.830 --> 08:47.470
I'm not sure. There's some echo.

08:51.510 --> 08:53.380
No time to hesitate.

08:54.110 --> 08:56.550
No matter what, we can't let 
any more of them get up there.

08:56.550 --> 08:59.260
Oh, fine. Guess we'd better get to work.

08:59.490 --> 09:04.600
Slaying goblins is, unfortunately, 
nothing but trouble and nuisance.

09:04.600 --> 09:06.810
I know... right?

09:06.810 --> 09:09.770
They're coming. They're coming! Both walls!

09:15.030 --> 09:16.980
Drink and sing, spirits!

09:16.980 --> 09:18.400
Sing, dance, and sleep like a log!

09:18.400 --> 09:20.620
Show me dreams of fire wine!

09:26.000 --> 09:27.140
Fools.

09:36.250 --> 09:38.970
I guess we can't let any 
of these get past us.

09:38.970 --> 09:40.600
I was never planning to.

09:40.600 --> 09:44.440
Sagitta... sinus... offero...

09:44.780 --> 09:46.290
Deflect Missile!

09:48.100 --> 09:49.310
A shaman!

09:52.480 --> 09:53.690
I'll leave him to you!

09:53.690 --> 09:57.830
Magna... remora... restinguitur.

09:57.830 --> 09:59.660
Counter Magic!

10:02.490 --> 10:06.770
Please... don't add... 
more work... to my... load.

10:06.770 --> 10:08.850
Well, that's your job.

10:08.850 --> 10:11.130
I'm definitely a better archer than you!

10:13.390 --> 10:14.300
Yes!

10:17.880 --> 10:18.510
Die.

10:23.960 --> 10:25.800
Do you have any spells left?

10:25.800 --> 10:27.890
Yes... I do.

10:27.890 --> 10:29.370
So do we.

10:29.370 --> 10:31.650
Shall I summon a dragontooth warrior?

10:31.650 --> 10:32.690
No.

10:33.260 --> 10:37.690
Orcbolg, you've got another 
terrible idea, haven't you?

10:38.140 --> 10:41.190
Yes. For the goblins.

10:42.880 --> 10:44.120
Did it go away?

10:44.380 --> 10:45.570
Looks like it.

10:45.570 --> 10:47.480
Maybe we will survive after all.

10:52.850 --> 10:55.800
There you are, you damned hob.

10:58.630 --> 11:02.090
Hey, kiddos. Wanna see something cool?

11:03.640 --> 11:06.660
I don't know what they've been teaching you,

11:06.660 --> 11:10.060
but I've only got one thing to teach you.

11:10.900 --> 11:15.020
No matter what kind of monster you're facing, 
they'll always have a physical body.

11:18.580 --> 11:23.260
So even if they're a god... 
you can still kill them!

11:28.790 --> 11:33.270
Damn it! I thought goblins 
were only in caves!

11:33.270 --> 11:35.960
Well, they're right there, 
so what do you want us to do?!

11:35.960 --> 11:39.260
We just need to... get to town...

11:53.090 --> 11:54.480
Wh-What in the world?!

11:56.480 --> 11:59.190
No one mentioned they could climb trees!

11:59.460 --> 12:01.690
What the hell are they laughing about?!

12:02.340 --> 12:04.320
They're mocking us.

12:04.560 --> 12:06.850
They're mocking us and slowly...

12:06.850 --> 12:08.030
Damn it!

12:09.780 --> 12:12.190
O merciful Earth Mother, please bless us,

12:12.190 --> 12:16.580
the wanderers in the
darkness, with holy light!

12:29.910 --> 12:31.650
Y-You guys are...

12:33.290 --> 12:34.730
We've come to save you.

12:40.720 --> 12:42.990
I'll never get used to the way this feels!

12:44.570 --> 12:45.660
They're still coming!

12:47.130 --> 12:50.460
Come closer, injured people! 
I'll treat your wounds!

12:50.460 --> 12:52.630
I'll only use miracles 
on the gravely injured!

12:52.630 --> 12:54.460
We all need to get out into the open.

12:54.460 --> 12:57.700
Having us stuck in a cramped area 
is just what the goblins want.

12:57.700 --> 13:00.550
B-But if they surround us in an open space...

13:01.090 --> 13:03.260
I will protect us using Protection.

13:03.480 --> 13:04.370
So hurry!

13:11.470 --> 13:12.600
Don't move!

13:31.040 --> 13:33.330
<i>I can't cast spells carelessly.</i>

13:37.330 --> 13:39.360
<i>The goblins are split up.</i>

13:39.360 --> 13:42.900
<i>I won't be able to hit several of 
them with just a single Fireball.</i>

13:44.490 --> 13:46.800
<i>But I also don't have any time to hesitate.</i>

13:47.300 --> 13:50.250
<i>Who knows what'll happen to 
us if we're caught by them?</i>

13:54.290 --> 13:57.770
<i>Who knows what my sister went through?</i>

14:00.200 --> 14:01.420
<i>Calm down.</i>

14:02.750 --> 14:05.690
<i>If I let my rage control me and 
I cast my spell in that state,</i>

14:05.690 --> 14:08.070
<i>I'm definitely gonna lose to that guy.</i>

14:08.320 --> 14:11.390
<i>Nah, it's not like he'd 
actually say anything.</i>

14:11.770 --> 14:14.700
<i>But I wouldn't be able to forgive myself.</i>

14:15.530 --> 14:16.750
<i>So what should I do?</i>

14:17.240 --> 14:18.210
<i>What do I do?!</i>

14:18.370 --> 14:22.560
Also, the job of a spell caster 
isn't to cast spells.

14:22.560 --> 14:24.840
It's to use spells.

14:25.200 --> 14:28.240
If you can't even tell them apart, 
there's no hope for you.

14:28.240 --> 14:31.440
Anyone who thinks a wizard is 
just someone who goes around

14:31.440 --> 14:35.020
throwing fireballs and 
lightning is a simpleton.

14:38.450 --> 14:40.100
Guys! Cover your ears!

14:40.100 --> 14:43.240
Hey! We're right in the 
middle of a battle here!

14:43.240 --> 14:45.070
Hurry! Get behind me!

14:47.250 --> 14:48.340
Oh, damn it!

14:48.940 --> 14:49.870
Um...

14:50.280 --> 14:51.720
I'll leave this to you.

14:53.330 --> 14:56.750
Go on! Cover your ears, too! Hurry!

14:57.690 --> 15:00.810
Crescunt! Crescunt! Crescunt!

15:11.390 --> 15:12.600
Oho?

15:12.600 --> 15:15.010
Sounds like the kid's getting serious.

15:27.610 --> 15:28.570
<i>They're running away?</i>

15:28.930 --> 15:33.030
<i>After doing as they please... 
running wild... killing...</i>

15:33.270 --> 15:36.100
<i>And yet they're running? 
They're running away?</i>

15:36.930 --> 15:38.210
<i>No way!</i>

15:38.530 --> 15:39.740
We're getting out of here.

15:41.410 --> 15:43.580
We're heading straight out 
of the forest to the town!

15:43.580 --> 15:47.050
All right! Getting home is our top priority!

15:47.050 --> 15:47.930
Follow me!

15:48.370 --> 15:53.210
He'll take the lead, and I'll watch over 
all these guys, so watch our rear for us.

15:53.210 --> 15:54.260
Right!

15:55.190 --> 15:56.770
What was that?!

15:56.770 --> 16:00.410
Just me yelling. I amplified it 
even more using Crescunt, though.

16:00.410 --> 16:02.910
Great job! That was amazing!

16:02.910 --> 16:03.850
Thanks.

16:05.380 --> 16:09.440
<i>The goal this time isn't to slay goblins.</i>

16:09.710 --> 16:11.480
<i>It's to save these guys.</i>

16:11.790 --> 16:14.280
<i>To save them and make it 
safely back into town.</i>

16:14.910 --> 16:19.410
<i>I wonder how much better I'd feel 
if I could massacre all the goblins.</i>

16:20.480 --> 16:24.170
<i>But... That's right. But...</i>

16:24.920 --> 16:27.250
I'm not Goblin Slayer!

16:28.750 --> 16:31.480
Up top. Open a hole above us!

16:31.480 --> 16:34.300
Again? All right, you got it!

16:35.160 --> 16:37.300
What's the point of makin' a hole?

16:37.300 --> 16:38.320
I have a plan.

16:38.810 --> 16:42.100
Before that, I want to scare them 
and move them farther back.

16:42.100 --> 16:43.730
Leave that to me.

16:43.730 --> 16:49.690
Bao Long, honored ancestor, 
Cretaceous ruler, I borrow now thy terror!

16:58.110 --> 17:00.120
They'll be back eventually!

17:00.810 --> 17:01.580
That's fine.

17:02.240 --> 17:06.770
Er, Orcbolg... You'd better not be thinking 
about using one of those scrolls again.

17:06.770 --> 17:08.810
I don't have any scrolls.

17:08.810 --> 17:10.300
Then what are we supposed to do?

17:11.070 --> 17:12.880
There's a lake above here.

17:26.930 --> 17:32.430
When the Tunnel spell runs out, 
could you cast some kind of ice spell?

17:32.430 --> 17:36.150
The ice will expand, and eventually, 
the tunnel will crumble.

17:36.400 --> 17:39.370
All right... I... understand.

17:39.830 --> 17:43.070
All that's left is to find their nest 
from up above and crush them.

17:43.070 --> 17:46.890
Yeah, you can do all that. I'm beat.

17:46.890 --> 17:51.540
Next time you call me, make sure there 
aren't any goblins on the adventure.

17:51.880 --> 17:52.440
All right.

17:52.440 --> 17:56.470
But I'm surprised that you knew 
that we were under a lake.

17:56.470 --> 18:00.470
Have you been in this area 
before, Sir Goblin Slayer?

18:00.780 --> 18:03.430
Yeah. Long ago.

18:04.140 --> 18:06.600
Long... long ago.

18:08.950 --> 18:11.270
Well, good work.

18:12.600 --> 18:14.480
Hey, great job.

18:14.480 --> 18:18.950
Don't worry. I know you're not lying.

18:18.950 --> 18:23.340
R-Right... But it's still nerve-racking.

18:23.660 --> 18:28.870
Well, in your case, you just had to 
work on your own accomplishments.

18:28.870 --> 18:32.710
Don't worry. I believe your rank 
definitely matches your hard work.

18:32.710 --> 18:38.420
You have good technique, a great reputation, 
and great luck, even if it's by chance.

18:38.950 --> 18:39.640
Right?

18:40.350 --> 18:42.640
Yes, you're right...

18:44.950 --> 18:47.480
I'm not sure just yet...

18:49.010 --> 18:52.190
But I'm going to do my 
best so I can find out!

18:56.330 --> 18:58.570
Heya! Great job!

18:58.570 --> 18:59.610
How'd it go?

19:00.450 --> 19:03.200
Thank you. I was able to rank up without issue.

19:03.200 --> 19:06.380
Way to go! Are you at the third level now?

19:06.380 --> 19:11.710
You actually made it to steel! 
Now you're a real priest, for sure!

19:11.710 --> 19:14.230
Yes. But...

19:14.790 --> 19:19.250
I, um... let some of the goblins escape.

19:20.760 --> 19:25.480
Now, listen. You're not 
Orcbolg, so that's fine.

19:25.480 --> 19:26.470
Right...

19:26.470 --> 19:30.410
It's because everyone has different 
thoughts and acts in different ways

19:30.410 --> 19:32.700
that the world is such an interesting place.

19:34.220 --> 19:35.020
Right!

19:37.610 --> 19:41.950
I'm thinking about traveling around the 
world a bit more to master my technique.

19:41.950 --> 19:44.800
You're not going to go back 
to the Sorcerers' Academy?

19:44.800 --> 19:48.300
I want to get revenge on the 
ones who mocked my sister.

19:48.300 --> 19:51.290
I mean, I do, but...

19:51.680 --> 19:56.200
I'm sure no matter what I do, 
they're gonna mock us anyway,

19:56.200 --> 19:59.630
so whatever. They can act 
stupid all their lives.

19:59.940 --> 20:01.000
Yeah.

20:01.970 --> 20:05.190
You know... I still don't like you.

20:06.570 --> 20:07.640
I see.

20:07.640 --> 20:10.680
So I gave it a lot of thought.

20:10.680 --> 20:14.100
I don't want to ever copy you. 
I'd rather be caught dead.

20:14.100 --> 20:15.180
That's why...

20:16.640 --> 20:18.730
I'm gonna be a dragon slayer!

20:22.530 --> 20:23.530
I see.

20:23.530 --> 20:25.990
Then I'll go with you!

20:25.990 --> 20:27.700
Wh-Wh-Wha—

20:27.700 --> 20:29.540
Why, though?!

20:29.750 --> 20:32.510
Well, a porcelain spell caster going 
on an adventure on his own

20:32.510 --> 20:34.070
is super dangerous!

20:34.070 --> 20:38.120
But you're also just a porcelain fighter. 
Not to mention, you're a girl.

20:38.120 --> 20:41.360
You bet! And that's why it's dangerous!

20:41.360 --> 20:44.120
Well, I was planning to travel alone!

20:44.120 --> 20:47.140
What a coincidence! So was I!

20:47.140 --> 20:50.780
Oh, damn it! This is the 
problem with you rheas!

20:56.200 --> 20:57.720
Mention my name

20:57.720 --> 21:00.380
if you happen to come across 
a rhea who goes by Burglar.

21:00.730 --> 21:03.780
He might just look after you.

21:05.280 --> 21:07.700
I guess I will if I remember.

21:08.170 --> 21:10.290
All right. I guess we should 
get going... together.

21:10.290 --> 21:11.070
Yeah!

21:11.420 --> 21:13.930
See you around, Goblin Slayer!

21:15.120 --> 21:16.010
Yeah.

21:19.020 --> 21:20.120
Are you done?

21:20.120 --> 21:21.030
Yeah.

21:22.430 --> 21:24.450
I guess they're going on an adventure.

21:24.450 --> 21:25.730
Are they now?

21:25.730 --> 21:26.560
Yeah.

21:28.140 --> 21:30.380
So the lake ran dry?

21:31.900 --> 21:32.790
Sorry.

21:38.110 --> 21:39.940
You seem happy.

21:41.670 --> 21:42.900
Do I look happy?

21:42.900 --> 21:45.060
Of course you do.

21:45.060 --> 21:45.990
I see.

21:45.990 --> 21:49.360
I know everything about you, you know!

21:50.450 --> 21:52.350
Something good must've happened.

21:54.090 --> 21:58.820
Yeah, something very good.

23:31.970 --> 23:40.020
<b>Next Time</b>

23:31.970 --> 23:40.020
<b>Beard-cutter, to the Southern River</b>
